 prey at a time. If she uses Hunt Prey against a creature when she already has a creature designated, the prior creature loses the designation and the new prey gains the designation. Her designation lasts until her next daily preparations.</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"rules":[{"key":"RollOption","label":"PF2E.SpecificRule.HuntPrey.TargetHuntedPrey","option":"hunted-prey","toggleable":true},{"key":"FlatModifier","predicate":["hunted-prey",{"or":["action:seek","action:track"]}],"selector":["perception","survival"],"type":"circumstance","value":2}],"slug":null,"traits":{"value":["concentrate"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!cSOYzZDc0jY14q7q.DdCgWbw8aUWSHIgY"},{"_id":"OgZDbMXP5WJGZbiw","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Liberating Strike","sort":1300000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"reaction"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"offensive","description":{"value":"<p><strong>Requirements</strong> Alyce is wielding a melee weapon</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> A creature within Alyce's reach attempts to apply the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.kWc1fhmv9LBiTuei]{Grabbed}, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.eIcWbB5o3pP6OIMe]{Immobilized}, or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.VcDeM8A5oI6VqhbM]{Restrained} condition to an ally</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> Alyce makes a melee Strike against the triggering creature. If the attack is a hit, the triggering ally can immediately use a reaction to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.SkZAQRkLLkmBQNB9]{Escape}. If the attack is a critical hit, any grabbed, immobilized, or restrained conditions imposed by the triggering action are negated.</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"value":[]},"_migration":{